      "title": "JEE Advanced 2023 (Paper 1)"
    }
  ],
  "question": {
    "text": "In an experiment for determination of the focal length of a thin convex lens, the distance of the object from the lens is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> and the distance of its real image from the lens is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>. The error in the determination of focal length of the lens is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>%</mo></math>. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> is _____.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "1",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given:</p><p>Object distance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math></p><p>Image distance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math></p><p>As per lens formula</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>v</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>u</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>f</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>f</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math></p><p>Differentiate equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;on both sides, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>f</mi></math></p><p>For calculating maximum error, we will add all values</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><mi>f</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><msup><mn>20</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Therefore,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><mi>f</mi></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>%</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
    "image": null
  },
